      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can significantly optimize and simplify this by avoiding creating new sets per page and skipping `set_difference`.\n\nInstead of collecting all widget annotations for the other page, you can iterate through its `Annots` array and `erase` directly from `widget_annots`. `std::set::erase` will safely do nothing if the annotation isn\u0027t in `widget_annots` (e.g. if it\u0027s not a widget or not shared).\n\n```cpp\n    RetainPtr\u003cconst CPDF_Array\u003e annots \u003d page_dict-\u003eGetArrayFor(kAnnots);\n    if (!annots) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    for (size_t j \u003d 0; j \u003c annots-\u003esize(); ++j) {\n      widget_annots.erase(annots-\u003eGetDictAt(j));\n      if (widget_annots.empty()) {\n        return;\n      }\n    }\n```\nThis avoids string comparisons in `IsWidgetAnnot()` for annotations that aren\u0027t on the current page, and skips allocating temporary sets.",
